{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12225730","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12225730","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:6:1222573001:1":{"text":"저 물고기는... 하라크인가요?","source_cn":"那条鱼……是哈拉克吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8AAF14F830E1840","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222573002:1":{"text":"유리병이 그를 봉인할 그릇이 되었군요!","source_cn":"玻璃瓶变成了封印他的容器！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x843164793360532E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1222573003:1":{"text":"아니요. 예쁜 장식품이 된 거죠! 제 꽃밭을 망가뜨린 하라크가 이젠 꽃밭의 장식품이 된 셈이에요.","source_cn":"不，是精美漂亮的摆件！哈拉克毁了我布置的小花园，现在就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D0260F118A57584","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1222573004:1":{"text":"아, 이빨을 안 드러내니까 이렇게 보면 병 속의 상어가 꽤 귀여운 것 같기도 하네요.","source_cn":"哎呀，只要不露出尖牙，从这个角度看，这条瓶中小鲨鱼好像...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1C6887A5AC2220E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222573005:1":{"text":"하라크가 나오진 않겠지?","source_cn":"哈拉克不会再跑出来吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3CBF5CE8714A885","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1222573006:0":{"text":"제 마법과 멀린의 봉인만 있다면 봉인이 깨지는 순간까지 영원히 꿈속에 빠져있을 거예요.","source_cn":"有我的魔法和梅林的封印，他会在梦境里沉睡，直到封印被破...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE147BD81A1AAA248","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"제 마법과 멀린의 봉인만 있다면 봉인이 깨지는 순간까지 영원히 꿈속에 빠져있을 거예요.","female":"제 마법과 멀린의 봉인만 있다면 봉인이 깨지는 순간까지 영원히 꿈속에 빠져있을 거예요.","variant_male_record_index":"137167","variant_female_record_index":"137168","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1222573007:0":{"text":"바로... 영. 원. 히. 말이죠!","source_cn":"也就是——永、远、哦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A6D41E8FDF452C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1222573008:0":{"text":"헤헤!","source_cn":"嘻嘻！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99A66619713B976E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1222573009:1":{"text":"악마를 봉인했으니 울머스 할아버지도 깨어나셨겠죠?","source_cn":"恶魔封印完成，奥曼斯是不是会醒来了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD32F0CAB486FF2A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1222573010:1":{"text":"당연하죠! 얼른 만나러 가봐요.","source_cn":"当然啦，咱们去找他吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x517E0118B012E1DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1222573011:0":{"text":"주무시는 동안 놓친 멋진 일들이 많아서, 얼른 들려 드리고 싶네요!","source_cn":"奥曼斯爷爷睡着这段时间错过了好多精彩的事情，我得赶快讲...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE41A22A72BA2A8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1222573012:0":{"text":"얼른, 빨리 따라와요!","source_cn":"快来，跟上跟上！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40624CE16206A15A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:24:12022095:0":{"text":"타시는 데빌 샤크 하라크를 반딧불이의 병에 가두고 황금의 땅을 원래 모습으로 복원했다.","source_cn":"塔西把鲨鱼恶魔哈拉克关进了萤之瓶，并把流金之地复原了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B66BF618294AAA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:塔西":{"text":"타시","source":"塔西","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"신밧드","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":18,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":5}}